      "properties": {
        "Node name for S/R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "This page restyles one picture. The bible cells are the style lock.\n\n1. Picture to restyle. It starts as the front cell, Down.\n   Drop a pose you just made onto that box.\n2. The bible. Nine cells, in the same 3x3 as the sheet.\n   Full sheet is that 3x3 as one picture.\n   Style lock: all nine averaged, the sheet, or one cell.\n3. Words. Click Use these words, then edit if you want.\n4. Style strength is the IP-Adapter. 0.8 is the start.\n   Sampler knobs: the last number is how much to repaint.\n   0.45 keeps the pose. 1 redraws it.\n5. Queue Prompt, then Approve or Deny.\n\nThis page does not turn her. New poses are WDB Character.\nThe gray row is the model load. Leave it collapsed."
      ],
      "color": "#8ec8f8",
      "bgcolor": "#1c3d5c",
      "title": "Start here"
    },
